WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:09.060
At iFranchise, we help you explore franchise opportunities and
prepare your business for expansion through franchising across
India.

2
00:00:09.260 --> 00:00:15.020
Our work covers franchise selection, model development, partner
information, and expansion planning.

3
00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:23.500
If you're investing, we begin with your budget, preferred city,
interests, and how involved you want to be in daily operations.

4
00:00:23.980 --> 00:00:27.820
We help you shortlist opportunities to discuss with the brands.

5
00:00:28.020 --> 00:00:33.540
We look beyond the brand name to consider how the business model
fits your circumstances.

6
00:00:34.020 --> 00:00:38.820
Review the complete investment, including setup costs, fees, and
working capital.

7
00:00:39.020 --> 00:00:45.180
Understand who operates the outlet, what support is offered, and
which responsibilities remain with you.

8
00:00:45.660 --> 00:00:49.740
Ask the brand for relevant information and clarify the commercial
terms.

9
00:00:49.940 --> 00:00:59.140
Before committing, arrange independent legal and financial advice
and review the agreement carefully. Business outcomes are never
guaranteed.

10
00:00:59.620 --> 00:01:04.020
If you want to franchise your business, we start with the
preparation you need.

11
00:01:04.220 --> 00:01:13.580
We work with you to consider how your economics, operating
processes, and customer experience could be repeated beyond your
current locations.

12
00:01:14.060 --> 00:01:21.740
We help you define your franchise model, territory approach, partner
responsibilities, and the support you plan to provide.

13
00:01:21.940 --> 00:01:27.220
Together, we turn those decisions into clear information for
prospective franchisees.

14
00:01:27.700 --> 00:01:33.540
We help you build a clear partner profile and present your business
through an informative brand listing.

15
00:01:33.740 --> 00:01:39.580
We discuss enquiries with you against your requirements, so you can
focus on relevant partner conversations.

16
00:01:40.060 --> 00:01:45.660
We help you plan for training, launch preparation, and ongoing
support from the beginning.

17
00:01:45.860 --> 00:01:52.660
We clarify handovers and expectations with you, so you and your
franchise partners understand how you will work together.

18
00:01:53.140 --> 00:01:57.940
We coordinate investor and brand discussions with you, keeping the
next steps clear.

19
00:01:58.140 --> 00:02:02.460
We agree the consulting scope around your business and the
preparation you need.

20
00:02:02.940 --> 00:02:09.660
Visit iFranchise dot in to explore franchise opportunities, read
practical guides, or list your brand.

21
00:02:09.860 --> 00:02:12.100
Talk to us about what you need.

